OL,3,GNEWSACherries match in Prague 'pinch me
OL,4,Amoment' for fan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bournemouth fan who is in Prague with
OL,7,Fhis son for the club's furthest away
OL,8,Fgame yet has described it as a "pinch
OL,9,Fme moment".
OL,11,FThursday's Europa League game will see
OL,12,Fthe Cherries play Sparta Prague at
OL,13,F17:45 GMT.
OL,15,FPlayers trained on the pitch on
OL,16,FWednesday evening ahead of the match,
OL,17,Fwhere more than a 1,000 away fans will
OL,18,Froar them on in the Czech capital.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
