OL,3,GNEWSACherries match in Prague 'pinch me
OL,4,Amoment' for fan
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatt, who is in Prague with his son
OL,7,FFelix, told the BBC: "I think it will
OL,8,Fbe a tough game, we're in it away from
OL,9,Fhome. I think the boys will do us
OL,10,Fproud."
